    "description": "New home for the original 151 🔥💦🌿\n\nIs there anything more satisfying than replacing a placeholder with the real card? ✨ Prepping my 151 Pokémon Binder in this forest green Vault-it’s honestly pure therapy.\n\nThe OG 151 set just hit differently. The nostalgia is real, but the Special Illustration Rares like Bulbasaur and Charmander are on a whole other level. I’m finally seeing those empty slots fill up, and the grind feels worth it ✨\n\nBe honest: If you could only keep one, are you picking the Bulbasaur IR or the Charmander IR?\nLet me know in the comments! 👇🏼\n\n#pokemon #pokemoncards #vaultx #pokemon151 #pokemoncommunity",
